text:
{
"opening": "To enhance concurrency handling and simplify the API, we are introducing condition-based synchronization for caching decorators and removing legacy components. These changes aim to mitigate cache stampede issues in parallel environments while cleaning up deprecated functionality.",
"requirements": [
{
"id": "m01",
"text": "The @cached and @cachedmethod decorators must accept an optional condition parameter that accepts a threading.Condition instance. When provided, this parameter replaces lock-based synchronization with condition-based waiting to mitigate cache stampede."
},
{
"id": "m02",
"text": "The fifo_cache, lfu_cache, lru_cache, rr_cache, and ttl_cache decorators must internally utilize a threading.Condition instance passed via the condition parameter of cached. This change replaces previous RLock-based synchronization to address cache stampede issues."
},
{
"id": "m03",
"text": "The MRUCache class and the mru_cache decorator must be removed from the library as a breaking change."
}
]
}
